## Already measured — do not redo

Overfit10 (10 demos, 2000 steps), on its own seeds: default loop 1/10 success, 3/10 grasped, 3.1 cm. Replan-16 with fixed noise: 0/10, 3/10, 3.3 cm. Inference tricks do not help. Offline, end-effector error vs the demo is 1.9 cm (3.5–4 cm at the start); replan jump ~3 cm vs 0.8 cm per demo step. The model learns the motion and misses the grasp. 10-episode evals are too noisy to rank checkpoints.

State normalization is 15-D. The `[6]` in `config.json` is cosmetic.

